# 오행부(MandateOfInk) — Git 속성 · LFS 설정
# 기본: 텍스트 자동 판별 + 줄바꿈 정규화
* text=auto

# Unity YAML (Force Text 직렬화) — 텍스트로 취급
*.cs text diff=csharp
*.meta text
*.unity text
*.prefab text
*.mat text
*.anim text
*.controller text
*.overrideController text
*.physicMaterial text
*.physicsMaterial2D text
*.playable text
*.mask text
*.brush text
*.flare text
*.fontsettings text
*.guiskin text
*.giparams text
*.renderTexture text
*.spriteatlas text
*.terrainlayer text
*.mixer text
*.shadervariants text
*.preset text
*.asmdef text
*.asmref text
*.rsp text
*.signal text
*.shader text
*.shadergraph text
*.shadersubgraph text
*.json text
*.md text
*.csv text
*.xml text
*.inputactions text

# .asset은 대부분 YAML 텍스트지만 일부는 바이너리 — 기본 텍스트, 예외는 LFS
*.asset text
LightingData.asset binary filter=lfs diff=lfs merge=lfs
NavMesh.asset binary filter=lfs diff=lfs merge=lfs
*Terrain*.asset binary filter=lfs diff=lfs merge=lfs

# 이미지 — LFS
